    "Description": "The httpd packages provide the Apache HTTP Server, a powerful, efficient, and extensible web server.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* httpd: Apache HTTP Server: Arbitrary code execution or denial of service via use-after-free in mod_ldap per-directory configuration (CVE-2026-29167)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
